Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:05.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Since we are celebrating 25 years\Nof AKKA celebrations,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.10,0:00:10.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,here are some Karnataka classic games\Nthat you can play with your kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.65,0:00:17.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,As a first-time parent, we did not know\Nwhat games would interest our kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.30,0:00:24.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,what games would build meaningful connections\Nand how to spend quality time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.55,0:00:32.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,We built an app called TryThis.fun\Nto have fun with your kids, nieces, and nephews.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.25,0:00:39.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,It has 100-plus games you can play\Nwithout even using a cell phone.
